#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:179
msgid "Key Parameter Descriptions:"
msgstr "关键参数说明："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:181
msgid ""
"Only the key parameters specific to this model/scenario are described below."
" `max-model-len` and `max-num-seqs` need to be set according to the actual "
"usage scenario."
msgstr "以下仅描述针对此模型/场景的关键参数。`max-model-len`和`max-num-seqs`需要根据实际使用场景进行设置。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:183
msgid "**Model-specific parameters:**"
msgstr "**模型相关参数：**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:185
msgid ""
"`--enable-expert-parallel`: Must be enabled for the MoE architecture of "
"GLM-5.2."
msgstr "`--enable-expert-parallel`：对于GLM-5.2的MoE架构必须启用。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:186
msgid ""
"`--quantization ascend`: Enables Ascend quantization for the w4a8c8 "
"quantized weights."
msgstr "`--quantization ascend`：为w4a8c8量化权重启用Ascend量化。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:187
msgid ""
"`--data-parallel-size 2` / `--tensor-parallel-size 8`: DP2 TP8 parallelism "
"layout, recommended to balance memory capacity and compute efficiency for "
"the w4a8c8 weights. For low-latency scenarios, use `dp1tp16` instead and "
"turn off expert parallel, at the cost of lower throughput."
msgstr ""
"`--data-parallel-size 2` / `--tensor-parallel-size 8`：DP2 "
"TP8并行布局，推荐用于平衡w4a8c8权重的内存容量和计算效率。对于低延迟场景，改用`dp1tp16`并关闭专家并行，但会降低吞吐量。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:188
msgid ""
"`--tool-call-parser glm47` / `--reasoning-parser glm45` / `--enable-auto-"
"tool-choice`: Enable function calling for GLM-5.2."
msgstr ""
"`--tool-call-parser glm47` / `--reasoning-parser glm45` / `--enable-auto-"
"tool-choice`：为GLM-5.2启用函数调用功能。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:189
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`--speculative-config '{\"num_speculative_tokens\": 3, \"method\": "
"\"deepseek_mtp\", \"enforce_eager\": true}'`: Enables Multi-Token Prediction"
" (MTP) speculative decoding with the DeepSeek-style MTP draft head of "
"GLM-5.2. `num_speculative_tokens` (3-5) controls how many tokens are "
"speculated per step; `enforce_eager: true` is required because GLM-5.2 does "
"not support graph-mode speculative decoding."
msgstr ""
"`--speculative-config '{\"num_speculative_tokens\": 3, \"method\": "
"\"deepseek_mtp\", \"enforce_eager\": "
"true}'`：启用多令牌预测（MTP）投机解码，使用GLM-5.2的DeepSeek风格MTP草稿头。`num_speculative_tokens`（3-5）控制每步推测的令牌数量；`enforce_eager:"
" true`是必需的，因为GLM-5.2不支持图模式投机解码。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:190
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\": \"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'`: Enables"
" graph capture for the decode phase only, improving decode performance by "
"reducing kernel launch overhead."
msgstr ""
"`--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\": "
"\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'`：仅对解码阶段启用图捕获，通过减少内核启动开销来提升解码性能。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:191
msgid ""
"`VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FUSED_MC2=0`: Disables the fused "
"`dispatch_ffn_combine`/`mega_moe` operators in this scenario because they "
"conflict with `multistream_overlap_shared_expert`; turn them on in multi-"
"node scenarios where they are beneficial."
msgstr ""
"`VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FUSED_MC2=0`：在此场景中禁用融合的`dispatch_ffn_combine`/`mega_moe`算子，因为它们与`multistream_overlap_shared_expert`冲突；在多节点场景中如果它们有益，可以启用。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:193
msgid "**`--additional-config` fields (Ascend-specific optimizations):**"
msgstr "**`--additional-config`字段（Ascend特定优化）：**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:195
msgid ""
"`\"enable_dsa_cp\": true`: Enables DSA context parallelism to accelerate "
"long-context prefill. Since v0.21.0, DSA-CP is decoupled from FlashComm1 and"
" must be enabled explicitly. With DSA-CP enabled, `layer_sharding` cannot "
"include `o_proj`."
msgstr ""
"`\"enable_dsa_cp\": true`：启用DSA上下文并行以加速长上下文预填充。自v0.21.0起，DSA-"
"CP与FlashComm1解耦，必须显式启用。启用DSA-CP后，`layer_sharding`不能包含`o_proj`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:196
msgid ""
"`\"enable_sparse_li_c8\": true`: Sparse attention optimizations of the C8 "
"quantized model. `enable_sparse_li_c8` accelerates the layer-index (LI) "
"sparse attention and is recommended to keep `true`; If the GPU memory is "
"insufficient due to a long sequence length, you are advised to enable "
"`enable_sparse_sfa_c8`."
msgstr ""
"`\"enable_sparse_li_c8\": "
"true`：C8量化模型的稀疏注意力优化。`enable_sparse_li_c8`加速层索引（LI）稀疏注意力，建议保持为`true`；如果因序列长度过长导致GPU内存不足，建议启用`enable_sparse_sfa_c8`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:197
msgid ""
"`\"enable_balance_scheduling\": true`: Balance scheduling improves output "
"throughput and reduces TPOT in the v1 scheduler. It replaces the deprecated "
"environment variable `VLLM_ASCEND_BALANCE_SCHEDULING`; TTFT may degrade in "
"some scenarios, and it is not recommended when Prefill-Decode is separated."
msgstr ""
"`\"enable_balance_scheduling\": "
"true`：均衡调度可提升输出吞吐量并降低v1调度器中的TPOT。它取代了已弃用的环境变量`VLLM_ASCEND_BALANCE_SCHEDULING`；在某些场景下TTFT可能会恶化，在Prefill-"
"Decode分离时不建议使用。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:198
msgid ""
"`\"multistream_overlap_shared_expert\": true`: Overlaps shared-expert "
"computation on an additional stream, improving decode efficiency."
msgstr "`\"multistream_overlap_shared_expert\": true`：在额外的流上重叠共享专家计算，提升解码效率。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:200
msgid "5.1.1.2 Multi-Node Co-Located Deployment"
