msgid "prepare the script `launch_online_dp.py` on each node:"
msgstr "在每个节点上准备脚本 `launch_online_dp.py`："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:408
msgid "**GLM-5.2-w8a8c8 (198K context, PD disaggregation with PP2):**"
msgstr "**GLM-5.2-w8a8c8（198K上下文，PP2 PD分离）：**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:410
msgid ""
"`GLM-5.2-w8a8c8` PD disaggregation can be deployed on 4 Atlas 800 A3 (128GB "
"× 8): 2 prefill nodes (`PP2 TP16`, 78 layers partitioned as `41/37`, one PP "
"rank per node) and 2 decode nodes (`DP8 TP4`, 4 DP ranks per node)."
msgstr ""
"`GLM-5.2-w8a8c8` PD 分离可部署在 4 个 Atlas 800 A3（128GB × 8）上：2 个预填充节点（`PP2 "
"TP16`，78 层划分为 `41/37`，每节点 1 个 PP rank）和 2 个解码节点（`DP8 TP4`，每节点 4 个 DP rank）。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:412
msgid ""
"**Prefill node 0** (`run_dp_template.sh`): `node_rank=0`, engine port `9081`"
" (PP master node, `--master-addr` uses `$local_ip`)."
msgstr ""
"**预填充节点 0**（`run_dp_template.sh`）：`node_rank=0`，引擎端口 `9081`（PP "
"主节点，`--master-addr` 使用 `$local_ip`）。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:484
msgid ""
"**Prefill node 1** (`run_dp_template.sh`): `node_rank=1`, non-master node "
"running with `--headless` (no API server). Both prefill nodes form a single "
"PP2 engine, so `--master-addr` points to prefill node 0 and the KV transfer "
"`engine_id` stays `0`."
msgstr ""
"**预填充节点 1**（`run_dp_template.sh`）：`node_rank=1`，以 `--headless` 模式运行的非主节点（无 "
"API 服务器）。两个预填充节点组成单个 PP2 引擎，因此 `--master-addr` 指向预填充节点 0，KV 传输 `engine_id` "
"保持为 `0`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:557
msgid ""
"**Decode node 0** (`run_dp_template.sh`): hosts DP ranks 0–3. The template "
"launches one instance per DP rank on the node; positional parameters: `$1` ="
" visible devices, `$2` = engine port, `$3` = data-parallel-size, `$4` = "
"data-parallel-rank, `$5` = data-parallel-address, `$6` = data-parallel-rpc-"
"port, `$7` = tensor-parallel-size. Prepare `run_dp_template.sh` on decode "
"node 0 with the content below."
msgstr ""
"**解码节点 0**（`run_dp_template.sh`）：承载 DP rank 0–3。模板在节点上为每个 DP rank "
"启动一个实例；位置参数：`$1` = 可见设备，`$2` = 引擎端口，`$3` = 数据并行大小，`$4` = 数据并行 rank，`$5` = "
"数据并行地址，`$6` = 数据并行 RPC 端口，`$7` = 张量并行大小。在解码节点 0 上准备包含以下内容的 "
"`run_dp_template.sh`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:631
msgid ""
"**Decode node 1** (`run_dp_template.sh`): hosts DP ranks 4–7. Prepare "
"`run_dp_template.sh` on decode node 1 with the content below."
msgstr ""
"**解码节点 1**（`run_dp_template.sh`）：承载 DP rank 4–7。在解码节点 1 上准备包含以下内容的 "
"`run_dp_template.sh`。"

