"When testing with a prefix cache hit rate > 0, add `--enable-prefix-caching`"
" on the prefill nodes (as in the script above); when the hit rate is 0, use "
"`--no-enable-prefix-caching` instead."
msgstr ""
"当使用前缀缓存命中率> 0进行测试时，在prefill节点上添加`--enable-prefix-"
"caching`（如上述脚本所示）；当命中率为0时，改用`--no-enable-prefix-caching`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:763
