"`\"recompute_scheduler_enable\"` is set to `false` on prefill nodes and "
"`true` on decode nodes in this scenario."
msgstr ""
"在此场景中，`\"recompute_scheduler_enable\"`在prefill节点上设置为`false`，在decode节点上设置为`true`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:765
#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:929
