msgstr ""
"此节点上每个 vLLM 引擎实例的起始端口。每个 DP rank 的引擎端口 = `vllm_start_port` + 本地 rank 索引。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:780
msgid "**Prefill node-specific configurations (PP2):**"
msgstr "**Prefill节点特定配置（PP2）：**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:782
msgid ""
"`VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION=\"41,37\"` / `--pipeline-parallel-size 2` / "
"`--node-rank`: The 78 layers are partitioned as `41/37` across 2 prefill "
"nodes (PP2). Set `node_rank=0` on prefill node 0 and `node_rank=1` on "
"prefill node 1."
msgstr ""
"`VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION=\"41,37\"` / `--pipeline-parallel-size 2` / "
"`--node-"
"rank`：78层在2个prefill节点（PP2）上划分为`41/37`。在prefill节点0上设置`node_rank=0`，在prefill节点1上设置`node_rank=1`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:783
msgid ""
"`VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FLASHCOMM1=1`: Enables FlashComm optimization to reduce "
"communication and computation overhead on prefill nodes. With FlashComm "
"enabled, `layer_sharding` cannot include `o_proj` as an element."
msgstr ""
"`VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FLASHCOMM1=1`：启用 FlashComm 优化以减少 prefill 节点上的通信和计算开销。启用 "
"FlashComm 后，`layer_sharding` 不能包含 `o_proj` 作为元素。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:784
msgid ""
"`VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FUSED_MC2=1`: Enables the "
"`dispatch_ffn_combine`/`mega_moe` fused operators. Note: fused MC2 conflicts"
" with `multistream_overlap_shared_expert`."
msgstr ""
"`VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FUSED_MC2=1`：启用 `dispatch_ffn_combine`/`mega_moe` "
"融合算子。注意：融合 MC2 与 `multistream_overlap_shared_expert` 存在冲突。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:785
msgid ""
"`ACL_OP_INIT_MODE=1` / `ASCEND_A3_ENABLE=1`: A3-specific optimizations for "
"operator initialization and communication aggregation."
msgstr "`ACL_OP_INIT_MODE=1` / `ASCEND_A3_ENABLE=1`：针对 A3 的算子初始化和通信聚合优化。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:786
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`--speculative-config '{\"num_speculative_tokens\": 1, ...}'`: Minimal MTP "
"speculation during prefill (decode nodes use a higher count, see below)."
msgstr ""
"`--speculative-config '{\"num_speculative_tokens\": 1, ...}'`：prefill "
"期间使用最小的 MTP 推测（decode 节点使用更高的数量，见下文）。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:787
#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1714
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`--additional-config '{\"recompute_scheduler_enable\": false, ...}'`: The "
"recompute scheduler is disabled on prefill nodes in this scenario."
msgstr ""
"`--additional-config '{\"recompute_scheduler_enable\": false, "
"...}'`：在此场景中，prefill节点上禁用重计算调度器。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:789
msgid "**Decode node-specific configurations:**"
msgstr "**Decode 节点特定配置：**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:791
msgid ""
"`--max-num-batched-tokens 164`: Small batch token limit on decode nodes — "
"decode processes one token per sequence per step, so batch tokens should be "
"close to `max-num-seqs`."
msgstr ""
"`--max-num-batched-tokens 164`：decode 节点上的较小批量 token 限制——decode 每步每个序列处理一个 "
"token，因此批量 token 应接近 `max-num-seqs`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:792
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`--speculative-config '{\"num_speculative_tokens\": 3, ...}'`: MTP "
"speculation count on decode nodes to maximize decode throughput."
msgstr ""
"`--speculative-config '{\"num_speculative_tokens\": 3, "
"...}'`：decode节点上的MTP推测数量，以最大化解码吞吐量。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:793
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`--additional-config '{\"recompute_scheduler_enable\": true}'`: Enables the "
"recomputation scheduler. When the decode node KV cache is insufficient, "
"requests are sent back to the prefill node to recompute the KV cache."
msgstr ""
"`--additional-config '{\"recompute_scheduler_enable\": "
"true}'`：启用重计算调度器。当decode节点KV缓存不足时，请求被发送回prefill节点以重新计算KV缓存。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:795
msgid "**Mooncake KV transfer configuration (`--kv-transfer-config`):**"
msgstr "**Mooncake KV 传输配置（`--kv-transfer-config`）：**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:797
msgid ""
"`\"kv_connector\": \"MooncakeConnectorV1\"`: Uses Mooncake as the KV cache "
"transfer connector between prefill and decode nodes."
msgstr ""
"`\"kv_connector\": \"MooncakeConnectorV1\"`：使用 Mooncake 作为 prefill 和 decode "
"节点之间的 KV 缓存传输连接器。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:798
msgid ""
"`\"kv_role\": \"kv_producer\"` / `\"kv_consumer\"`: `kv_producer` on prefill"
" nodes, `kv_consumer` on decode nodes."
msgstr ""
"`\"kv_role\": \"kv_producer\"` / `\"kv_consumer\"`：prefill 节点上为 "
"`kv_producer`，decode 节点上为 `kv_consumer`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:799
msgid ""
"`\"kv_port\"`: Port for Mooncake KV transfer communication. Use different "
"port ranges for prefill (`30000`) and decode (`30200`) node groups."
msgstr ""
"`\"kv_port\"`：Mooncake "
"KV传输通信端口。为prefill（`30000`）和decode（`30200`）节点组使用不同的端口范围。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:800
msgid ""
"`\"use_ascend_direct\": true`: Enables Ascend direct transfer for KV cache, "
"reducing latency."
msgstr "`\"use_ascend_direct\": true`：为 KV 缓存启用 Ascend 直接传输，降低延迟。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:801
msgid ""
"`\"prefill\"` / `\"decode\"` sections: Specify the parallelism of the "
"prefill and decode node groups respectively. These must match the actual "
"deployment topology (`prefill: pp_size 2, tp_size 16, pp_layer_partition "
"41,37`, `decode: dp_size 8, tp_size 4`)."
msgstr ""
"`\"prefill\"` / "
"`\"decode\"`部分：分别指定prefill和decode节点组的并行度。这些必须与实际部署拓扑匹配（`prefill: pp_size 2, "
"tp_size 16, pp_layer_partition 41,37`，`decode: dp_size 8, tp_size 4`）。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:803
msgid "**Request forwarding (proxy):**"
msgstr "**请求转发（代理）：**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:805
msgid ""
"The proxy command maps every prefill engine endpoint (1 prefiller host/port)"
" and every decode engine endpoint (8 decoder hosts/ports) to a single entry "
"point on port `9000`."
msgstr ""
"代理命令将每个预填充引擎端点（1 个预填充器主机/端口）和每个解码引擎端点（8 个解码器主机/端口）映射到端口 `9000` 上的单个入口点。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:806
msgid ""
"The proxy program can be found in "
"[load_balance_proxy_server_example.py](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/examples/disaggregated_prefill_v1/load_balance_proxy_server_example.py)."
msgstr ""
"代理程序可在 [load_balance_proxy_server_example.py](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/examples/disaggregated_prefill_v1/load_balance_proxy_server_example.py)"
" 中找到。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:808
#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1221
msgid ""
"Please refer to [envs.py](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/vllm_ascend/envs.py) for further explanation and "
"restrictions of the environment variables above."
msgstr ""
"请参阅 [envs.py](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/vllm_ascend/envs.py) 以了解上述环境变量的进一步说明和限制。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:810
msgid "5.1.2 Atlas 800 A2"
msgstr "5.1.2 Atlas 800 A2"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:812
msgid "5.1.2.1 Multi-Node Co-Located Deployment"
msgstr "5.1.2.1 多节点共置部署"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:814
msgid ""
"`GLM-5.2-w4a8c8` (experimental): can be deployed on 2 Atlas 800 A2 (64GB × "
"8). A single Atlas 800 A2 node (8 × 64GB) cannot fit the w4a8c8 weights, so "
"the 2-node deployment is the minimum configuration for the A2 series."
msgstr ""
"`GLM-5.2-w4a8c8`（实验性）：可部署在2个Atlas 800 A2（64GB × 8）上。单个Atlas 800 A2节点（8 × "
"64GB）无法容纳w4a8c8权重，因此2节点部署是A2系列的最小配置。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:931
msgid ""
"The A2 series uses a different optimization stack than A3: FlashComm1 and "
"DSA-CP are not used here."
msgstr "A2 系列使用与 A3 不同的优化栈：此处不使用 FlashComm1 和 DSA-CP。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:933
msgid "**A2-specific environment variables:**"
msgstr "**A2 专用环境变量：**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:935
msgid ""
"`CPU_AFFINITY_CONF=1`: Enables CPU core affinity binding for worker "
"processes."
msgstr "`CPU_AFFINITY_CONF=1`：为工作进程启用 CPU 核心亲和性绑定。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:936
msgid ""
"`ACL_OP_INIT_MODE=1`: ACL operator initialization mode to speed up operator "
"compilation."
msgstr "`ACL_OP_INIT_MODE=1`：ACL 算子初始化模式，用于加速算子编译。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:937
msgid ""
"`VLLM_RPC_TIMEOUT=360000` / `VLLM_EXECUTE_MODEL_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=3000` / "
"`HCCL_EXEC_TIMEOUT=200` / `HCCL_CONNECT_TIMEOUT=120` / "
"`VLLM_ENGINE_READY_TIMEOUT_S=1200`: Timeout settings for multi-node startup "
"and model execution on the slower A2 platform. Increase them if the engine "
"fails to become ready in time."
msgstr ""
"`VLLM_RPC_TIMEOUT=360000` / `VLLM_EXECUTE_MODEL_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=3000` / "
"`HCCL_EXEC_TIMEOUT=200` / `HCCL_CONNECT_TIMEOUT=120` / "
"`VLLM_ENGINE_READY_TIMEOUT_S=1200`：在较慢的 A2 "
"平台上用于多节点启动和模型执行的超时设置。如果引擎无法及时就绪，请增大这些值。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:939
msgid "5.1.2.2 Prefill-Decode Disaggregation"
msgstr "5.1.2.2 预填充-解码分离"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:941
msgid ""
"On Atlas 800 A2, where each node exposes 8 cards, the same global P/D "
"topology (Prefill `DP4 TP8`, Decode `DP8 TP4`) is split across 8 nodes: 4 "
"prefill nodes hosting 1 DP rank each (8 cards per rank), and 4 decode nodes "
"hosting 2 DP ranks each (4 cards per rank). The `launch_online_dp.py` above "
"is reused as-is. The prefill side enables FlashComm1 and DSA CP; the decode "
"side enables MLAPO and `DYNAMIC_EPLB` with a `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` graph. Both "
"sides enable prefix caching and MTP (`num_speculative_tokens=1` on prefill, "
"`3` on decode). All IPs, NIC names, ports and weight paths below are "
"placeholders."
msgstr ""
"在 Atlas 800 A2 上，每个节点提供 8 张卡，相同的全局 P/D 拓扑（预填充 `DP4 TP8`，解码 `DP8 TP4`）分布在 8 "
"个节点上：4 个预填充节点各承载 1 个 DP rank（每个 rank 8 张卡），4 个解码节点各承载 2 个 DP rank（每个 rank 4 "
"张卡）。上述 `launch_online_dp.py` 原样复用。预填充侧启用 FlashComm1 和 DSA CP；解码侧启用 MLAPO 和带有"
" `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` 图的 `DYNAMIC_EPLB`。两侧均启用前缀缓存和 MTP（预填充侧 "
"`num_speculative_tokens=1`，解码侧为 `3`）。以下所有 IP、网卡名称、端口和权重路径均为占位符。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:943
msgid ""
"**Note:** `GLM-5.2-w4a8c8` is an experimental feature with known accuracy "
"issues in Prefill-Decode (PD) disaggregation scenarios (see [Model "
"Weight](#31-model-weight))."
msgstr ""
"**注意：** `GLM-5.2-w4a8c8` 是实验性功能，在预填充-"
"解码（PD）分离场景中存在已知的精度问题（参见[模型权重](#31-model-weight)）。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:945
msgid ""
"Please refer to the [KV Cache Pool (Ascend Store) Deployment "
"Guide](https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/ascend/zh-"
"cn/latest/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.html) for the KV Cache Pool "
"startup method and the Mooncake configuration file."
msgstr ""
"有关 KV 缓存池（Ascend Store）的启动方法和 Mooncake 配置文件，请参阅 [KV 缓存池（Ascend "
"Store）部署指南](https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/ascend/zh-"
"cn/latest/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.html)。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:947
msgid "`run_dp_template.sh` for the prefill nodes:"
