#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1156
msgid ""
"For request forwarding on this 8-node A2 layout, use 4 prefiller hosts (1 "
"endpoint each) and 4 decoder hosts (2 endpoints each) in the Request "
"Forwarding command below."
msgstr "对于此8节点A2布局的请求转发，请在下面的请求转发命令中使用4个预填充主机（每个1个端点）和4个解码主机（每个2个端点）。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1189
msgid ""
"Key Parameter Descriptions (in addition to [Prefill-Decode "
"Disaggregation](#5113-prefill-decode-disaggregation)):"
msgstr "关键参数说明（除 [预填充-解码分离](#5113-prefill-decode-disaggregation) 中所述之外）："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1191
msgid ""
"This 8-node A2 layout splits the global P/D topology across 8 Atlas 800 A2 "
"nodes: 4 prefill nodes hosting 1 DP rank each (8 cards per rank, `DP4 TP8`) "
"and 4 decode nodes hosting 2 DP ranks each (4 cards per rank, `DP8 TP4`). "
"The `launch_online_dp.py` script is the same as in [Prefill-Decode "
"Disaggregation](#5113-prefill-decode-disaggregation)."
msgstr ""
"此 8 节点 A2 布局将全局 P/D 拓扑分布在 8 台 Atlas 800 A2 节点上：4 个预填充节点各承载 1 个 DP rank（每个 "
"rank 8 张卡，`DP4 TP8`），4 个解码节点各承载 2 个 DP rank（每个 rank 4 张卡，`DP8 "
"TP4`）。`launch_online_dp.py` 脚本与 [预填充-解码分离](#5113-prefill-decode-"
"disaggregation) 中的相同。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1193
msgid "**Prefill node-specific configurations (A2):**"
msgstr "**预填充节点专用配置（A2）：**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1195
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`--additional-config '{\"enable_sparse_sfa_c8\": true, "
"\"enable_sparse_li_c8\": true, ...}'`: Both SFA C8 optimizations are enabled"
" in this scenario."
msgstr ""
"`--additional-config '{\"enable_sparse_sfa_c8\": true, "
"\"enable_sparse_li_c8\": true, ...}'`：在此场景中启用了两种SFA C8优化。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1197
msgid "**Decode node-specific configurations (A2):**"
msgstr "**解码节点专用配置（A2）：**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1199
msgid ""
"`VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_MLAPO=1`: MLAPO fusion on decode nodes for memory-"
"bandwidth-bound token generation."
msgstr "`VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_MLAPO=1`：在解码节点上启用 MLAPO 融合，用于内存带宽受限的 token 生成。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1200
msgid ""
"`--max-num-batched-tokens 256`: Small batch token limit on decode nodes."
msgstr "`--max-num-batched-tokens 256`：解码节点上的小批量 token 限制。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1202
msgid ""
"**Multi-connector KV transfer configuration (`--kv-transfer-config`):**"
msgstr "**多连接器 KV 传输配置（`--kv-transfer-config`）：**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1204
msgid ""
"`\"kv_connector\": \"MultiConnector\"`: Combines multiple KV transfer "
"connectors."
msgstr "`\"kv_connector\": \"MultiConnector\"`：组合多个 KV 传输连接器。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1205
msgid ""
"`MooncakeConnectorV1`: Mooncake KV cache transfer between prefill and decode"
" nodes (same role as in [Prefill-Decode Disaggregation](#5113-prefill-"
"decode-disaggregation))."
msgstr ""
"`MooncakeConnectorV1`：预填充和解码节点之间的 Mooncake KV 缓存传输（与 [预填充-"
"解码分离](#5113-prefill-decode-disaggregation) 中的角色相同）。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1206
msgid ""
"`AscendStoreConnector`: The KV Cache Pool (Ascend Store) connector, "
"available since v0.23.0 — see the [KV Cache Pool (Ascend Store) Deployment "
"Guide](https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/ascend/zh-"
"cn/latest/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.html)."
msgstr ""
"`AscendStoreConnector`：KV 缓存池（Ascend Store）连接器，自 v0.23.0 起可用——参见 [KV "
"缓存池（Ascend Store）部署指南](https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/ascend/zh-"
"cn/latest/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.html)。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1207
msgid ""
"`\"kv_load_failure_policy\": \"recompute\"`: When a KV block fails to load "
"from the KV pool, the request falls back to recomputation instead of "
"failing."
msgstr "`\"kv_load_failure_policy\": \"recompute\"`：当 KV 块从 KV 池加载失败时，请求回退到重计算而不是失败。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1208
msgid ""
"`\"load_async\": true` (decode side): Asynchronously loads KV cache from the"
" pool on decode nodes."
msgstr "`\"load_async\": true`（解码侧）：在解码节点上从池中异步加载 KV 缓存。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1209
msgid "`\"backend\": \"mooncake\"`: The Ascend Store backend used by the connector."
msgstr "`\"backend\": \"mooncake\"`：连接器使用的 Ascend Store 后端。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1211
msgid "**Environment variables for the A2 PD scenario:**"
msgstr "**A2 PD 场景的环境变量：**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1213
msgid "`VLLM_USE_V1=1`: Forces the v1 scheduler."
msgstr "`VLLM_USE_V1=1`：强制使用 v1 调度器。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1214
msgid ""
"`ASCEND_AGGREGATE_ENABLE=1` / `ASCEND_TRANSPORT_PRINT=1`: Communication "
"aggregation and transport debug printing."
msgstr "`ASCEND_AGGREGATE_ENABLE=1` / `ASCEND_TRANSPORT_PRINT=1`：通信聚合和传输调试打印。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1215
msgid ""
"`PYTHONHASHSEED=0`: Fixed hash seed for reproducible distributed scheduling."
msgstr "`PYTHONHASHSEED=0`：用于可复现分布式调度的固定哈希种子。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1216
msgid ""
"`MOONCAKE_CONFIG_PATH=\"/mnt/share/scripts/mooncake.json\"`: Path to the "
"Mooncake configuration file (must exist on each node)."
msgstr ""
"`MOONCAKE_CONFIG_PATH=\"/mnt/share/scripts/mooncake.json\"`：Mooncake "
"配置文件的路径（必须存在于每个节点上）。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1217
msgid ""
"`HCCL_INTRA_ROCE_ENABLE=1`: Enables HCCL intra-node communication over RoCE."
msgstr "`HCCL_INTRA_ROCE_ENABLE=1`：启用通过 RoCE 的 HCCL 节点内通信。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1218
msgid "`ACL_OP_INIT_MODE=1`: ACL operator initialization mode."
msgstr "`ACL_OP_INIT_MODE=1`：ACL 算子初始化模式。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1219
msgid ""
"`VLLM_HOST_IP=$local_ip`: Host IP advertised by the decode engine for cross-"
"node communication."
msgstr "`VLLM_HOST_IP=$local_ip`：解码引擎为跨节点通信通告的主机 IP。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1223
msgid "5.2 1M Context Deployment"
msgstr "5.2 1M 上下文部署"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1225
msgid ""
"The 1M context scenarios are validated on Atlas 800 A3 only; the A2 series "
"is not validated for 1M context."
msgstr "1M 上下文场景仅在 Atlas 800 A3 上验证；A2 系列未针对 1M 上下文进行验证。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1228
msgid ""
"For GLM-5.2's Sparse Flash Attention (SFA) backend, when using DCP in PD "
"disaggregation, enable it on both the prefiller and decoder nodes, or "
"disable it on both. Enabling DCP on only one side can cause known accuracy "
"issues."
msgstr ""
"对于GLM-5.2的稀疏Flash注意力（SFA）后端，在PD分离中使用DCP时，请在预填充节点和解码节点上同时启用或同时禁用DCP。仅在一侧启用DCP可能会导致已知的精度问题。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1230
msgid ""
"DCP and Sparse Flash Attention C8 (`enable_sparse_sfa_c8`, also referred to "
"as `sfa_c8`) have different behavior depending on the weight version:"
msgstr ""
"DCP和Sparse Flash Attention "
"C8（`enable_sparse_sfa_c8`，也称为`sfa_c8`）根据权重版本具有不同的行为："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1232
msgid ""
"`GLM-5.2-w8a8c8`: they can be enabled together — the reference w8a8c8 "
"configs in this document enable both."
msgstr "`GLM-5.2-w8a8c8`：它们可以同时启用——本文档中的参考w8a8c8配置同时启用了两者。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1233
msgid ""
"`GLM-5.2-w4a8c8`: enabling them together has known issues in v0.23.0, "
"including performance degradation, and is not recommended."
msgstr "`GLM-5.2-w4a8c8`：在 v0.23.0 中同时启用它们存在已知问题，包括性能下降，不建议这样做。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1236
msgid "5.2.1 Dual-Node Co-Located 1M Deployment"
msgstr "5.2.1 双节点共置 1M 部署"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1238
msgid "**GLM-5.2-w8a8c8 (1M context, dual-node co-located):**"
msgstr "**GLM-5.2-w8a8c8（1M 上下文，双节点共置）：**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1240
msgid ""
"`GLM-5.2-w8a8c8` 1M co-located deployment on 2 Atlas 800 A3 (128GB × 8) "
"(`DP8 TP4`, 4 DP ranks per node, decode context parallelism 4)."
msgstr ""
"`GLM-5.2-w8a8c8` 1M 共置部署在 2 个 Atlas 800 A3（128GB × 8）上（`DP8 TP4`，每节点 4 个 DP "
"rank，解码上下文并行度 4）。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1365
msgid "5.2.2 PD Disaggregation 1M Deployment"
msgstr "5.2.2 PD 分离 1M 部署"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1367
msgid "**GLM-5.2-w8a8c8 (1M context, PD disaggregation):**"
msgstr "**GLM-5.2-w8a8c8（1M 上下文，PD 分离）：**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1369
msgid ""
"`GLM-5.2-w8a8c8` 1M PD disaggregation can be deployed on 4 Atlas 800 A3 "
"(128GB × 8): 2 prefill nodes (`DP2 TP16`, 1 DP rank per node, decode context"
" parallelism 16) and 2 decode nodes (`DP8 TP4`, 4 DP ranks per node, decode "
"context parallelism 4)."
msgstr ""
"`GLM-5.2-w8a8c8` 1M PD 分离可部署在 4 个 Atlas 800 A3（128GB × 8）上：2 个预填充节点（`DP2 "
"TP16`，每节点 1 个 DP rank，解码上下文并行度 16）和 2 个解码节点（`DP8 TP4`，每节点 4 个 DP "
"rank，解码上下文并行度 4）。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1371
msgid ""
"**Prefill node 0** (`run_dp_template.sh`): DP rank 0, engine port `9081`. "
"The value of `node_p0_ip` must be consistent with the `local_ip` set on "
"prefill node 0 (DP master node)."
msgstr ""
"**Prefill 节点 0**（`run_dp_template.sh`）：DP rank 0，引擎端口 `9081`。`node_p0_ip` "
"的值必须与 prefill 节点 0（DP 主节点）上设置的 `local_ip` 保持一致。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1441
msgid ""
"**Prefill node 1** (`run_dp_template.sh`): DP rank 1, engine port `9082`. "
"`--data-parallel-address` still points to prefill node 0 (DP master node)."
msgstr ""
"**Prefill 节点 1**（`run_dp_template.sh`）：DP rank 1，引擎端口 `9082`。`--data-"
"parallel-address` 仍指向 prefill 节点 0（DP 主节点）。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1511
msgid ""
"**Decode node 0** (`run_dp_template.sh`): hosts DP ranks 0–3. Prepare "
"`run_dp_template.sh` and `launch_online_dp.py` (see [Prefill-Decode "
"Disaggregation](#5113-prefill-decode-disaggregation)) on decode node 0 with "
"the content below."
msgstr ""
"**解码节点 0**（`run_dp_template.sh`）：承载 DP rank 0–3。在解码节点 0 上准备包含以下内容的 "
"`run_dp_template.sh` 和 `launch_online_dp.py`（参见[预填充-解码分离](#5113-prefill-"
"decode-disaggregation)）。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1583
msgid ""
"**Decode node 1** (`run_dp_template.sh`): hosts DP ranks 4–7. Prepare "
"`run_dp_template.sh` and `launch_online_dp.py` (see [Prefill-Decode "
"Disaggregation](#5113-prefill-decode-disaggregation)) on decode node 1 with "
"the content below."
msgstr ""
"**解码节点 1**（`run_dp_template.sh`）：承载 DP rank 4–7。在解码节点 1 上准备包含以下内容的 "
"`run_dp_template.sh` 和 `launch_online_dp.py`（参见[预填充-解码分离](#5113-prefill-"
"decode-disaggregation)）。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1657
msgid "Prefill node 0: run the script above (DP rank 0, port `9081`)."
msgstr "Prefill 节点 0：运行上述脚本（DP rank 0，端口 `9081`）。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1659
msgid "Prefill node 1: run the script above (DP rank 1, port `9082`)."
msgstr "Prefill 节点 1：运行上述脚本（DP rank 1，端口 `9082`）。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1709
msgid ""
"Key Parameter Descriptions (in addition to [Prefill-Decode "
"Disaggregation](#5113-prefill-decode-disaggregation) and [Dual-Node Co-"
"Located 1M Deployment](#521-dual-node-co-located-1m-deployment)):"
msgstr ""
"关键参数说明（除 [Prefill-Decode 分离](#5113-prefill-decode-disaggregation) 和 [双节点共置 "
"1M 部署](#521-dual-node-co-located-1m-deployment) 之外）："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1711
msgid "**Prefill nodes (1M):**"
msgstr "**Prefill 节点（1M）：**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1713
msgid ""
"`--prefill-context-parallel-size 1` / `--decode-context-parallel-size 16` / "
"`--cp-kv-cache-interleave-size 128`: Decode context parallelism of 16 for "
"the decode phase of the 1M scenario."
msgstr ""
"`--prefill-context-parallel-size 1` / `--decode-context-parallel-size 16` / "
"`--cp-kv-cache-interleave-size 128`：1M 场景解码阶段的解码上下文并行度为 16。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1715
msgid ""
"`--kv-transfer-config`: Mooncake connector as `kv_producer` with `prefill: "
"dp2 tp16` / `decode: dp8 tp4`."
msgstr ""
"`--kv-transfer-config`：Mooncake 连接器作为 `kv_producer`，配置为 `prefill: dp2 tp16` "
"/ `decode: dp8 tp4`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1717
msgid "**Decode nodes (1M):**"
msgstr "**Decode 节点（1M）：**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1719
msgid ""
"`--decode-context-parallel-size 4` / `--cp-kv-cache-interleave-size 128`: "
"Decode context parallelism of 4 per decode node."
msgstr ""
"`--decode-context-parallel-size 4` / `--cp-kv-cache-interleave-size 128`：每个 "
"decode 节点的解码上下文并行度为 4。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1720
msgid ""
"`--max-num-batched-tokens 192`: Decode nodes store the large 1M KV cache "
"received from prefill nodes."
msgstr "`--max-num-batched-tokens 192`：Decode 节点存储从 prefill 节点接收的大型 1M KV 缓存。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1721
msgid ""
"`--kv-transfer-config`: Mooncake connector as `kv_consumer` (`kv_port: "
"30200`)."
msgstr ""
"`--kv-transfer-config`：Mooncake 连接器作为 `kv_consumer`（`kv_port: 30200`）。"

