#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1787
msgid ""
"The following optimizations must be explicitly enabled to take effect. They "
"apply to the A3 series (w8a8c8) or the A2 series (w4a8c8) as indicated:"
msgstr "以下优化必须显式启用才能生效。它们适用于 A3 系列（w8a8c8）或 A2 系列（w4a8c8），具体如下所示："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "Optimization"
msgstr "优化项"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "Enablement"
msgstr "启用方式"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "Principle (Benefits)"
msgstr "原理（收益）"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "备注"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "FlashComm_v1"
msgstr "FlashComm_v1"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "A3 prefill nodes / co-located nodes"
msgstr "A3 prefill 节点 / 共置节点"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "`export VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FLASHCOMM1=1`"
msgstr "`export VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FLASHCOMM1=1`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid ""
"Splits AllReduce into Reduce-Scatter and All-Gather, improving prefill "
"throughput and reducing communication latency"
msgstr "将 AllReduce 拆分为 Reduce-Scatter 和 All-Gather，提升 prefill 吞吐量并降低通信延迟"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "Not available when `layer_sharding` includes `o_proj`"
msgstr "当 `layer_sharding` 包含 `o_proj` 时不可用"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "Fused MC2"
msgstr "Fused MC2"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "A3 prefill nodes"
msgstr "A3 prefill 节点"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "`export VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FUSED_MC2=1`"
msgstr "`export VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FUSED_MC2=1`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid ""
"Replaces ALLTOALL+MC2 with the "
"`dispatch_ffn_combine`/`dispatch_gmm_combine_decode` operators, reducing MoE"
" communication overhead and improving MoE inference performance"
msgstr ""
"使用 `dispatch_ffn_combine`/`dispatch_gmm_combine_decode` 算子替代 ALLTOALL+MC2，降低"
" MoE 通信开销并提升 MoE 推理性能"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid ""
"`dispatch_ffn_combine` only for w8a8, EP≤32, non-MTP, non-dynamic-EPLB; "
"conflicts with `multistream_overlap_shared_expert` (the latter is auto-"
"disabled)"
msgstr ""
"`dispatch_ffn_combine` 仅适用于 w8a8、EP≤32、非 MTP、非动态 EPLB；与 "
"`multistream_overlap_shared_expert` 冲突（后者会自动禁用）"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "MLAPO"
msgstr "MLAPO"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "A3 co-located / PD decode nodes; A2 P/D nodes"
msgstr "A3 共置 / PD decode 节点；A2 P/D 节点"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "`export VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_MLAPO=1`"
msgstr "`export VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_MLAPO=1`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid ""
"Fuses the MLA preprocess operations, significantly improving decode "
"performance"
msgstr "融合 MLA 预处理操作，显著提升解码性能"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "Consumes more NPU memory; in PD scenarios enable on decode nodes only"
msgstr "消耗更多 NPU 内存；在 PD 场景中仅需在 decode 节点上启用"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "DSA CP"
msgstr "DSA CP"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "A3 prefill nodes; long context (≥128K)"
msgstr "A3 prefill 节点；长上下文（≥128K）"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`--additional-config '{\"enable_dsa_cp\": true}'`"
msgstr "`--additional-config '{\"enable_dsa_cp\": true}'`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid ""
"DSA context parallelism accelerates long-context prefill, reducing TTFT for "
"long prompts"
msgstr "DSA上下文并行加速长上下文预填充，降低长提示的TTFT"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid ""
"In the reference configs, enabled on co-located nodes and PD prefill nodes; "
"PD decode nodes use decode context parallelism instead"
msgstr "在参考配置中，在共置节点和PD预填充节点上启用；PD解码节点改用解码上下文并行"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "Balance Scheduling"
msgstr "均衡调度"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "A3 single-node / co-located / non-PD scenarios"
msgstr "A3单节点/共置/非PD场景"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`--additional-config '{\"enable_balance_scheduling\": true}'`"
msgstr "`--additional-config '{\"enable_balance_scheduling\": true}'`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "Improves output throughput and reduces TPOT in the v1 scheduler"
msgstr "在v1调度器中提升输出吞吐量并降低TPOT"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "TTFT may degrade; not recommended when Prefill-Decode is separated"
msgstr "TTFT可能下降；在预填充-解码分离时不推荐使用"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "Sparse SFA C8"
msgstr "稀疏SFA C8"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "A3 (w8a8c8); long-context prefill"
msgstr "A3（w8a8c8）；长上下文预填充"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`--additional-config '{\"enable_sparse_sfa_c8\": true}'`"
msgstr "`--additional-config '{\"enable_sparse_sfa_c8\": true}'`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid ""
"Sparse Flash Attention skips unnecessary attention computation of the C8 "
"quantized model, accelerating long-context prefill"
msgstr "稀疏Flash Attention跳过C8量化模型中不必要的注意力计算，加速长上下文预填充"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid ""
"Experimental in v0.23.0. On the w8a8c8 weights it can be combined with "
"DCP/context parallelism (as in the reference configs in this document); on "
"the w4a8c8 weights enabling both together has known issues and is not "
"recommended"
msgstr ""
"v0.23.0中为实验性功能。在w8a8c8权重上可与DCP/上下文并行结合使用（如本文档中的参考配置）；在w4a8c8权重上同时启用两者存在已知问题，不推荐使用"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "Sparse LI C8"
msgstr "稀疏LI C8"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "A3 (w8a8c8)"
msgstr "A3（w8a8c8）"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`--additional-config '{\"enable_sparse_li_c8\": true}'`"
msgstr "`--additional-config '{\"enable_sparse_li_c8\": true}'`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid ""
"Sparse attention optimization reduces computation of the C8 quantized model,"
" improving throughput"
msgstr "稀疏注意力优化减少C8量化模型的计算量，提升吞吐量"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "Independent of `enable_sparse_sfa_c8`"
msgstr "与`enable_sparse_sfa_c8`相互独立"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "Recompute Scheduler"
msgstr "重计算调度器"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "A3 decode nodes"
msgstr "A3解码节点"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`--additional-config '{\"recompute_scheduler_enable\": true}'`"
msgstr "`--additional-config '{\"recompute_scheduler_enable\": true}'`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid ""
"Recomputes KV cache on prefill nodes when decode KV cache is insufficient, "
"avoiding decode-side OOM and improving throughput"
msgstr "当解码KV缓存不足时在预填充节点上重计算KV缓存，避免解码端内存溢出并提升吞吐量"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "Set to `false` on prefill nodes"
msgstr "在预填充节点上设置为`false`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "Multistream Overlap Shared Expert"
msgstr "多流重叠共享专家"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "A3"
msgstr "A3"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`--additional-config '{\"multistream_overlap_shared_expert\": true}'`"
msgstr "`--additional-config '{\"multistream_overlap_shared_expert\": true}'`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid ""
"Overlaps shared-expert computation on an additional stream, hiding its "
"latency and improving decode performance"
msgstr "在额外的流上重叠共享专家计算，隐藏其延迟并提升解码性能"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "Auto-disabled when `VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FUSED_MC2=1`"
msgstr "当`VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FUSED_MC2=1`时自动禁用"

