msgid ""
"For complete startup commands and detailed parameter descriptions, please "
"refer to the deployment examples and Key Parameter Descriptions in "
"[Deployment](#5-deployment)."
msgstr "有关完整的启动命令和详细的参数说明，请参阅[部署](#5-deployment)中的部署示例和关键参数说明。"

