msgstr "高吞吐"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "Long Context"
msgstr "长上下文"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "`--max-num-seqs`"
msgstr "`--max-num-seqs`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "Lower (4–12)"
msgstr "较低（4–12）"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "Higher (6–64)"
msgstr "较高（6–64）"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "Controlled (6–64)"
msgstr "受控（6–64）"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid ""
"Limits concurrent sequences. Lower values reduce scheduling latency; higher "
"values increase throughput."
msgstr "限制并发序列数。较低的值减少调度延迟；较高的值提升吞吐量。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "`--max-model-len`"
msgstr "`--max-model-len`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "Shorter (40K–135K)"
msgstr "较短（40K–135K）"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "Longer (128K–200K)"
msgstr "较长（128K–200K）"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "Maximum (1M)"
msgstr "最大（1M）"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid ""
"Maximum context length. Must accommodate your longest input+output. Larger "
"values consume more KV cache memory."
msgstr "最大上下文长度。必须容纳最长的输入+输出。较大的值消耗更多KV缓存内存。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "`--max-num-batched-tokens`"
msgstr "`--max-num-batched-tokens`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "Lower (4096–8192)"
msgstr "较低（4096–8192）"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "Higher for prefill (8192–16384)"
msgstr "预填充时较高（8192–16384）"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "Higher for prefill (8192)"
msgstr "预填充较高（8192）"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid ""
"Controls batch size per step. Lower values reduce per-step latency; higher "
"values improve prefill throughput."
msgstr "控制每步的批处理大小。较低的值减少每步延迟；较高的值提高预填充吞吐量。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "`--gpu-memory-utilization`"
msgstr "`--gpu-memory-utilization`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "0.92–0.95"
msgstr "0.92–0.95"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "0.90–0.95"
msgstr "0.90–0.95"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "0.90–0.92"
msgstr "0.90–0.92"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid ""
"NPU memory fraction. The reference w8a8c8 1M configs in this document use "
"0.90 (PD prefill) to 0.92 (co-located / PD decode). Reduce if OOM."
msgstr "NPU内存比例。本文档中的参考w8a8c8 1M配置使用0.90（PD预填充）到0.92（共置/PD解码）。若发生内存溢出请调低。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "`--enable-chunked-prefill`"
msgstr "`--enable-chunked-prefill`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "Enable"
msgstr "启用"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid ""
"Splits long prompts into chunks to prevent prefill from blocking decode. "
"Recommended in all scenarios."
msgstr "将长提示拆分为多个块，防止预填充阻塞解码。所有场景下均推荐使用。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "`num_speculative_tokens` (MTP)"
msgstr "`num_speculative_tokens`（MTP）"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "3–5"
msgstr "3–5"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "1 (prefill) / 3–5 (decode)"
msgstr "1（预填充）/ 3–5（解码）"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid ""
"MTP speculation count. Higher values improve decode throughput at the cost "
"of memory for the draft model KV cache. Use `1` on prefill nodes in PD mode."
msgstr "MTP推测数量。较高的值以提高解码吞吐量为代价，消耗草稿模型KV缓存的内存。在PD模式下，预填充节点上使用`1`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "`cudagraph_mode`"
msgstr "`cudagraph_mode`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "FULL_DECODE_ONLY"
msgstr "FULL_DECODE_ONLY"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid "FULL_DECODE_ONLY (co-located / decode nodes)"
msgstr "FULL_DECODE_ONLY（共置/解码节点）"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md:1227
msgid ""
"Graph capture for the decode phase only. Prefill nodes in PD mode use "
"`--enforce-eager` instead."
msgstr "仅对解码阶段进行图捕获。PD模式下的预填充节点改用`--enforce-eager`。"

